coverage/

# Husky internals (auto-generated by `husky`); the hook scripts are tracked
.husky/_/

# Cargo test-fixture OUTPUT copies — each run of excel_real_file.rs /
# powerpoint_real_file.rs writes a fresh "sample L<n>[ <m>].ext" beside the
# tracked source fixture (sample.xlsx / sample.pptx). Only the source
# fixtures are tracked; the auto-incrementing run outputs are regenerable.
humanize/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/sample L*.xlsx
humanize/src-tauri/tests/fixtures/sample L*.pptx

# Stray empty scratch dir from an early `supabase` CLI call run from the
